title: Labor Rights
new-page: true
is-card: true
on-arrival: labor_rights_timer += 6; month_actions += 1
view-if: dems_in_government = 1 and labor_rights_timer <= 0 
card-image: img/department_of_labor.png
tags: govt_affairs, cabinet

= Labor Rights

Corporations are attempting to avoid what limited regulations we have involving the rights of their workers. This government will do everything in its power to both expand the scope of these regulations and ensure companies are following them.

- @working_hours_overtime: Expand Threshold For Overtime Pay
- @restrict_gig_workers: Tighten The Classification Of "Gig Workers", To Force Companies To Pay Full Benefits To Their Workers
- @safety: Develop and Enforce OSHA Safety Regulations.
- @enforce_woke_dei: Target Corporations Accused Of Hiring Discrimination
- @root: Do not enact any policies.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

